, check-in 2026-11-12 for 2 nights at $189/night, $378 total (reservation R0003). This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged:** $667. That's under the $1000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\n**What went wrong:** My first booking attempt timed out. When I resent it, the service said the flight had been booked and charged (R0001, $289) but the hotel step had failed. I cancelled the part that went through, which refunded R0001's $289, then sent the full booking again and it succeeded. The reservation list now shows R0001 as cancelled and only R0002 and R0003 as active, so nothing was booked twice.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017oXrVDfbbnZbKBHMgjvgog", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_017gKnCTmeQPWq9wCAvsxH7a", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under the $1000 approval threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_011uwukNjHADrYZGHvEVcVxj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-sfo-jfk-20261112"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The request timed out, so I can't tell yet whether anything went through. Resending with the same idempotency key is safe: if the first request ran, the service will just return its result.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01VpEHaBDDYyXUcJu4gVx1y8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"f